==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{ON.|is}} ''[[veikr]]''.

===Adjective===
'''veikur''' {{m}}, [[veik]] {{f}}, [[veikt]] {{n}}

# [[weak]], [[pliant]]
# [[sick]], [[ill]]
#: ''Hún er '''veik'''.''
#:: She's '''sick'''.
#: ''Hann er '''veikur'''.''
#:: He's '''sick'''.
#: ''[[barn#Icelandic|Barnið]] er '''veikt'''.''
#:: The [[child]] is '''sick'''.
# {{context|of a sound|lang=is}} [[faint]], [[low]]
# {{music|lang=is}} [[soft]], [[piano]]

